		<div class="w-full px-4 grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-8 gap-y-24 ">
							
																						<article class="flex flex-col enter-stagger-item "><div class="w-full h-px mb-6 bg-orange"></div><p class="subhead subhead-small my-0">September 9, 2026</p><h1 class="font-medium text-2xl">Simplify label printing workflows: Smarter Intelligent Forms and expanded direct cloud printing</h1><div class="rich-text">
		BarTender Cloud Labeling 12.4 simplifies label printing with expanded direct cloud printing for TSC printers and smarter Intelligent Forms. These enhancements help reduce IT dependencies, streamline printer setup, improve operator efficiency, and minimize labeling errors through more responsive, guided workflows.
	</div><a href="https://www.bartendersoftware.com/resources/library/release-notes/simplify-label-printing-workflows-smarter-intelligent-forms-and-expanded-direct-cloud-printing" class="text-lg font-medium inline-flex items-center no-underline arrow-link mt-6"><span>					Read more
			</span><span class="arrow arrow-after"><svg class="arrow-bar" width="21" height="3" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 21 3" aria-hidden="false"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" d="M0 1.5h21"/></svg><svg class="arrow-tip" width="7" height="11" viewBox="0 0 7 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="false"><path d="M1 9.5L5 5.5L1 1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg></span></a></article>
																								<article class="flex flex-col enter-stagger-item "><div class="w-full h-px mb-6 bg-orange"></div><p class="subhead subhead-small my-0">August 26, 2026</p><h1 class="font-medium text-2xl">Strengthen your labeling infrastructure: Enhanced security, compatibility, and Hybrid Labeling</h1><div class="rich-text">
		BarTender 12.1 enhances security, compatibility, and Hybrid Labeling with SQL Server 2025 support, improved cloud-to-on-premises synchronization, expanded API capabilities, and streamlined printing workflows.
	</div><a href="https://www.bartendersoftware.com/resources/library/release-notes/strengthen-your-labeling-infrastructure-enhanced-security-compatibility-and-hybrid-labeling" class="text-lg font-medium inline-flex items-center no-underline arrow-link mt-6"><span>					Read more
			</span><span class="arrow arrow-after"><svg class="arrow-bar" width="21" height="3" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 21 3" aria-hidden="false"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" d="M0 1.5h21"/></svg><svg class="arrow-tip" width="7" height="11" viewBox="0 0 7 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="false"><path d="M1 9.5L5 5.5L1 1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg></span></a></article>
																								<article class="flex flex-col enter-stagger-item "><div class="w-full h-px mb-6 bg-orange"></div><p class="subhead subhead-small my-0">August 26, 2026</p><h1 class="font-medium text-2xl">Deploy item tracking faster: Simplified configuration and expanded integrations</h1><div class="rich-text">
		BarTender Track & Trace 12.5 introduces bulk configuration management, expanded GS1 support, configuration history tracking, and dashboard refreshes to help organizations deploy item tracking faster, improve data accuracy, and maintain consistency across sites.
	</div><a href="https://www.bartendersoftware.com/resources/library/release-notes/deploy-item-tracking-faster-simplified-configuration-and-expanded-integrations" class="text-lg font-medium inline-flex items-center no-underline arrow-link mt-6"><span>					Read more
			</span><span class="arrow arrow-after"><svg class="arrow-bar" width="21" height="3" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 21 3" aria-hidden="false"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" d="M0 1.5h21"/></svg><svg class="arrow-tip" width="7" height="11" viewBox="0 0 7 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="false"><path d="M1 9.5L5 5.5L1 1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg></span></a></article>
